18:10.940 --> 18:11.260
Et donc,

18:12.240 --> 18:13.180
la relation entre eux,

18:13.500 --> 18:14.280
on a déjà commencé

18:14.280 --> 18:14.720
à traiter.

18:15.040 --> 18:15.120
Donc,

18:15.160 --> 18:15.500
on voit

18:15.500 --> 18:16.900
comment ces premiers

18:16.900 --> 18:18.640
trois éléments

18:18.640 --> 18:19.700
