26:52.680 --> 26:53.360
Les doutes

26:53.360 --> 26:53.860
envers

26:53.860 --> 26:54.800
mon assurance

26:54.800 --> 26:55.300
de salut

26:55.300 --> 26:56.520
ne changent en rien

26:56.520 --> 26:57.540
l'assurance

26:57.540 --> 26:58.140
en soi

26:58.140 --> 26:58.660
de mon salut,

26:58.820 --> 26:59.380
car l'assurance

26:59.380 --> 26:59.740
de mon salut

