29:30.740 --> 29:31.660
nous vivrons

29:31.660 --> 29:32.480
à la proportion

29:32.480 --> 29:34.160
de cette vie

29:34.160 --> 29:35.260
symétriquement

29:35.260 --> 29:35.900
parfaite

29:35.900 --> 29:36.320
équilibrée

29:36.320 --> 29:36.780
du Christ

29:36.780 --> 29:38.840
selon

29:38.840 --> 29:40.540
la fidélité

29:40.540 --> 29:41.560
